    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "Characterful Three Bedroom End-Terrace Residence\n\nKinsella Estates Gorey are delighted to bring this very spacious three-bedroom end-of-terrace residence at Hollyfort, Gorey, Co. Wexford to the market.\nThe property has recently been tastefully decorated and offers bright, well-proportioned and spacious living accommodation throughout. A particular feature of the property is the south-facing rear garden, which enjoys a private aspect and is not overlooked to the rear. Double doors from the kitchen/dining area provide direct access to the patio and garden, creating an ideal space for outdoor dining and entertaining.\nThis attractive home is conveniently located in the village of Hollyfort, with the local shop and pub just a short stroll away. The surrounding countryside also offers a choice of nearby Coillte woodland walks, making this an appealing location for those seeking a peaceful rural setting while remaining within easy reach of Gorey and surrounding towns.\nHollyfort is conveniently situated approximately 3 km from Monaseed, 8 km from Gorey, 10 km from Carnew and 4 km from Kilanerin.\nWith its generous accommodation, private south-facing rear garden and convenient village location, this property would make an ideal starter home or family residence.\nViewing is highly recommended by the Auctioneer\n\n\nBER: E2 115481137, 372.19 kWh,\nEir Code: Y25 Y328\nHouse Size: 93.7 sq. mt. (1,009 sq. ft.)\nFolio: WX70749F\n\nServices: \n•Mains Water\n•Mains Sewerage\n•Oil Fired Central Heating\n\nACCOMMODATION\n\nGround Floor\n\nEntrance Hall:\nTiled floor\n\nKitchen/Dining Room: 5.9m x 3.5m\nTiled floor & splash back\nDouble doors onto patio area\n\nUtility Area: \nTiled \n\nLiving Room: 4.4m x 3.6m\nSolid Fuel stove\nTimber floor\nCoving\n\nShower room: \nFully Tiled\n\nBedroom 1: 4.4m x 2.8m\nCoving\n\nFirst Floor\n\nMaster Bedroom: 4.2m x 3.7m\nTimber floor\nFeature brick fire place\nBuilt in wardrobe\n\nBedroom 3: 4.2m x 2.8m\nTimber floor\nBuilt in wardrobe\n\nBathroom: 2.5m x 1.6m\nTiled Walls and Feature Brick\n\nRear of Property\nNot overlooked to the rear\nPatio area \nSouth facing back garden\n\nFront of Property\nNorth facing with ample parking space's\n"
